/davey-edward-secretary-of-state-for-energy-and-climate-change-acoba-recommendation/summary-of-business-appointments-applications-rt-hon-edward-davey"}},{"phase":"career","start":"2015-09","end":null,"title":"Chairman","organisation":"Mongoose Energy","detail":"Part time paid role; ACOBA advised a six month waiting period from leaving ministerial office, and the appointment was announced in September 2015.","source":{"title":"GOV.UK ACOBA: Summary of business appointments applications, Rt Hon Sir Edward Davey","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/davey-edward-secretary-of-state-for-energy-and-climate-change-acoba-recommendation/summary-of-business-appointments-applications-rt-hon-edward-davey"}},{"phase":"career","start":"2016-01","end":null,"title":"Consultant","organisation":"MHP Communications","detail":"Part of the role was developing MHP's business and giving its clients strategic advice on communications and government relations; the appointment was announced in January 2016.","source":{"title":"GOV.UK ACOBA: Summary of business appointments applications, Rt Hon Sir Edward Davey","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/davey-edward-secretary-of-state-for-energy-and-climate-change-acoba-recommendation/summary-of-business-appointments-applications-rt-hon-edward-davey"}},{"phase":"career","start":"2016-02","end":null,"title":"Non executive director","organisation":"Nord Engine Capital","detail":"Part time paid position with the private equity investor, announced in February 2016.","source":{"title":"GOV.UK ACOBA: Summary of business appointments applications, Rt Hon Sir Edward Davey","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/davey-edward-secretary-of-state-for-energy-and-climate-change-acoba-recommendation/summary-of-business-appointments-applications-rt-hon-edward-davey"}},{"phase":"career","start":"2016-04","end":null,"title":"Trustee","organisation":"Tourism for All","detail":"Part time unpaid role with the accessible tourism cha